{
  "id": "commerce-selection-heldout-v3",
  "split": "heldout",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "coffee-fresh-v3",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "我在北京三里屯，给我看看附近还开门的麦当劳，最近一家有啥能点的？暂不购买。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.search_stores",
              "commerce.menu"
            ],
            "no_checkout": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "来个中杯热美式。先核对真实详情，确实是热的再做预览，不许换成冰的。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "clarification_required",
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.product_detail"
            ],
            "no_checkout": true,
            "reply_contains": [
              "冰"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "好吧，改成店里那款冰美式中杯，两杯默认，带走。仅预览哈。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_names": [
              "麦咖啡™冰美式中杯"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              2
            ],
            "take_way_title": "外带",
            "cart_matches_detail": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "朋友不喝了，只留我那一杯，别动品种和取餐方式，也别提交。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_names": [
              "麦咖啡™冰美式中杯"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              1
            ],
            "take_way_title": "外带",
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "还是在餐厅喝，其他都按刚才的，给我重新看下报价就行。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_names": [
              "麦咖啡™冰美式中杯"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              1
            ],
            "take_way_title": "堂食",
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "这杯也不要了，取消尚未提交的那份。今天的训练饮食别碰。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "cancelled"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "cancelled"
            ],
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 3
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}